# ── Agent one-shot debris (NOT needed for cargo test / run) ─────────────
# Keep in git: crates/**/src/**/*.rs, Cargo.toml, and crates/ol-sim/build.rs
# plus only the build_*.rs modules that `build.rs` actually `mod`s (~27 files).
# Delete freely: Python/ps1 one-shots, .rs.txt snippets, orphan build_* injectors
# not listed in build.rs, and build-stamp dotfiles.
**/_patch_*.py
**/_apply_*.py
**/_fix_*.py
**/_run_*.py
**/_run_*.ps1
**/_inject_*.py
**/_strip_*.py
**/_wire_*.py
**/_finalize_*.py
**/_patch_*.txt
